mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">豆包工作任务模式上线技能、连接器与工作伙伴三大功能</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI全面开源Codex Harness，开放AI编程智能体底层运行框架</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic 在 Claude Platform 正式上线 Computer Use、Skills API 与 Files API</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴开源 Qwen-UI-Agent 真机多模态 GUI 智能体基座模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9441ff3cea1797e0f581040dd68e13eb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴正式开源 GUI 智能体基座模型 Qwen-UI-Agent，旨在实现移动端、电脑端、网页端及深度搜索环境下的真实设备无缝操作。该模型在 MobileWorld 测试中斩获 82.1% 分数，在自建百台真机基准 MobileWorld-Real 上成功率达 92.2%，在 OSWorld-Verified 与 WebArena 测试中均表现领先。Qwen-UI-Agent 搭建了覆盖 100 多台真机与 150 多个应用的训练环境，支持批量动作输出以缩短执行轨迹，并具备超 100 步长程任务的在线强化学习能力。在安全管控方面，模型内置全过程判断机制，针对支付、隐私授权等敏感场景可主动拦截并请求用户确认。该模型通过从模拟到真实的训练范式，有效提升了 Agent 在复杂真实环境下的操作成功率与安全性，为开发</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云千问AI平台接入GLM-5.3与DeepSeek-V4-Pro模型并开放API</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/368aa05201c9aff87be2716b08304668.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里云千问AI平台（MaaS）近日完成模型矩阵更新，正式上线智谱GLM-5.3与DeepSeek-V4-Pro旗舰模型，并同步对外开放配套API服务。GLM-5.3重点强化了编程、长程任务执行及网络安全能力；DeepSeek-V4-Pro则针对智能体交互进行升级，适配代码开发与多步骤复杂任务处理。目前，千问AI平台已覆盖文本、代码、语音、图像及视频五大模型赛道，聚合了Qwen3.8-Max、Qwen-Image3.0Pro、Wan3.0及Kimi K3等主流模型。在商业化层面，平台推出Token Plan套餐服务，支持用户在Qoder、Codex等开发工具内灵活切换模型。此次更新进一步完善了平台的全场景模型供给，旨在为开发者与企业提供更丰富的选型空间，加速智能体及代码类应用的落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">豆包工作任务模式上线技能、连接器与工作伙伴三大功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f8bb140131f33454b4f6258b393c4b73.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">豆包工作任务模式近日迎来重磅更新，正式上线技能、连接器与工作伙伴三大功能，标志着其从对话助手向智能办公平台转型。目前平台已上架超200个技能与连接器，并支持用户自主创建专属技能以固化工作流。技能功能允许用户将项目周报等工作规范保存为个人技能，实现流程复用；连接器则打通了豆包与飞书等外部办公工具，支持在应用内直接处理任务，减少页面切换。工作伙伴功能提供数据分析、内容策划、科研及金融等领域的专业智能体，用户可组建智能体小队协同完成复杂任务。三大功能既可独立使用，也可自由组合，旨在通过留存工作标准、调取外部信息及多智能体协作，简化办公流程并提升职场效率。用户现可通过豆包电脑版侧边栏进入「技能·连接器·伙伴」入口体验上述功能。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI全面开源Codex Harness，开放AI编程智能体底层运行框架</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3dc7558b6757f99938aa45834da1392c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式全面开源Codex Harness，向开发者开放驱动Codex智能体运行的核心框架。Codex Harness作为连接模型、用户与工具的底层环境，负责管理Agent Loop、线程生命周期、持久化、身份认证及工具执行机制。开发者可通过Codex App Server利用双向JSON-RPC协议将Harness接入各类客户端，构建IDE插件、桌面应用等定制化Agent。该框架目前已支撑Codex Web、CLI及macOS应用等场景。OpenAI内部实践显示，基于该框架可实现由Agent执行代码的工程闭环，曾支撑5个月内产出100万行代码及1500个Pull Request。此次开源标志着AI编程竞争重心从单纯的模型能力，转向Agent运行时、上下文管理及工程反馈闭环的标准化，助力开发者构建更专业</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic 在 Claude Platform 正式上线 Computer Use、Skills API 与 Files API</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/080fe9189b1afd9bb85fd10d4f20ed83.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic 宣布 Claude Platform 的 Computer Use、Skills API 及 Files API 进入全面可用阶段。核心更新包括全新的浏览器使用工具，支持网页结构解析，可精准识别并操作特定网页元素。电脑操作功能现支持单次调用执行多项连续动作，并符合 HIPAA 标准，适用于受监管的医疗工作负载。Skills API 允许企业管理专属技能文件夹并在安全沙盒中运行脚本；Files API 提供 1TB 专属存储空间，速率限制提升至原来的 5 倍，支持 PDF 及电子表格等文件引用。此次更新旨在赋能企业构建生产级智能体，实现复杂业务流程自动化。开发者可通过 Microsoft Foundry 使用相关 API，且电脑操作与浏览器使用工具即将登陆 Google Cloud Verte</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
